flowchart TD
    Health[GET /health]
    HealthResponse[Return status and agent_loaded flag]
    Chat[POST /chat]
    Validate[Pydantic QueryRequest]
    Ready{Agent loaded?}
    UUID[Generate response UUID]
    Thread[asyncio.to_thread]
    Week8[Week 8 CostOptimizedSQLAgent]
    Response[QueryResponse JSON]
    NotReady[HTTP 503]
    Failure[HTTP 500 on agent error]

    Health --> HealthResponse
    Chat --> Validate
    Validate --> Ready
    Ready -->|No| NotReady
    Ready -->|Yes| UUID
    UUID --> Thread
    Thread --> Week8
    Week8 -->|Success| Response
    Week8 -->|Exception| Failure

    LMStudio[LM Studio chat and embedding APIs]
    LMStudio --> Week8

    note1[Local development API: no authentication, database execution, Phoenix tracing, streaming, or Dockerfile]
    note1 -.-> Chat
